{"sections":[{"slug":"同伦融贯脉","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"同伦融贯脉"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">同伦融贯脉</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“同伦融贯脉”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯集","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯集</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">范畴和</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的范畴之间有如下伴随</span>.</p>\n<p>$$\r\n\\mathfrak C \\colon \\mathsf {sSet} \\leftrightarrows \\mathsf {Cat}_{\\Delta} \\colon \\mathfrak N\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于单纯范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$, <span lang=\"zh\">函子</span> $\\mathfrak C[S]\\to\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $S$ <span lang=\"zh\">形的</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">同伦融贯交换图</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">的模型</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">而</span> $\\mathfrak C[\\mathfrak N(\\mathcal D)]\\to\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">是无穷范畴之间的函子</span> $\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">的模型</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">注意单纯范畴之间的函子</span> $\\mathcal D\\to \\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">不是</span> $\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴之间的函子的正确模型</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}